  "Release tags of the game: [release] tag of configs/gw_release.ltx, [addon] game_version (15-merge-implementation.md 2.2). '[v|V] N(.N)* [-suffix]': N - ASCII digits up to 4294967295; -patchN (any case) a patch, any other suffix of A-Z a-z 0-9 '.' a pre-release. Engine MergeParseTag / MergeCompareTags / ReleaseTagOlder (xray-16/src/xrGame/addon_merge.cpp), tools/addons_snapshot/gametag.py (the validator imports it).",
  "parse: expect null - not a tag; numbers without the trailing zeros (1.4.0 == 1.4), kind pre / release / patch, patch - N of -patchN, pre - the pre-release suffix in lower case. The value is not trimmed (the callers trim an ltx value first).",
  "compare: -1 / 0 / 1 (a older / the same / newer). Same numbers: pre-release < release < -patch0 < -patch1; two pre-releases - the suffixes in lower case compared as byte strings.",
  "older: [addon] game_version older than the tag of the game (ReleaseTagOlder): empty or equal strings - no; a value that is not a tag - any difference is older."
 ],
